 "_comment": "Every playable start in the installed game, PER CAMPAIGN MAP. Harvested from the game's own frontend by walking the lord list at campaign-select and reading each entry's node id -- not typed by hand. Regenerate a map with BusLauncher().harvest_startable_factions(campaign_map=...) while that map's campaign-select screen is showing.\n\nKEYED BY MAP because the rosters genuinely differ: 79 of Immortal Empires' 104 starts do not exist on Realm of Chaos, and it is not even a clean race subset -- Warriors of Chaos offers 8 lords on Immortal Empires and 4 on Realm of Chaos. A flat list meant `--factions all` handed the Immortal Empires roster to whatever map --campaign selected, so most launches could not have succeeded.\n\nThere is deliberately NO top-level `factions` key any more. Leaving one would let a reader that has not been taught about maps keep working and keep being wrong; without it, such a reader fails loudly.",
